cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Learning Connection Time metric, its methodology, or the acquisition pipeline design, please cite this work as below."
title: "Learning Connection Time (LCT)"
abstract: "Learning Connection Time transforms student-to-teacher ratios into minutes of potential individual instructional time per student per day, and acquires actual school bell schedules through a nine-stage per-school acquisition pipeline to measure educational equity across U.S. school districts."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McCullough
    given-names: Ian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6004-1846"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ianmmc/learning-connection-time"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - educational equity
  - instructional time
  - student-teacher ratio
  - bell schedules
  - school districts
